{"schemaVersion":1,"patchVersion":"26.20","sources":{"ddragon":"16.20.1","cdragon":"16.20"},"locale":"zh_CN","champions":{"Kindred":{"E:横生惧意":{"slot":"E","skill":{"id":"KindredEWrapper","name":"横生惧意","maxrank":5,"cooldown":[14,12.5,11,9.5,8],"cooldownBurn":"14/12.5/11/9.5/8","description":"羊灵进行一发谨慎的定位射击，来使目标减速。如果羊灵又进行了两次攻击，那么她的第三次攻击会指挥狼灵扑向目标，对目标造成巨量伤害。","summary":"羊灵进行一发谨慎的定位射击，来使目标减速。如果羊灵又进行了两次攻击，那么她的第三次攻击会指挥狼灵扑向目标，对目标造成巨量伤害。","tooltip":"千珏弱化一名敌人，对其造成持续1.5秒的(30 + ([[si:scaleap]]5% 法术强度))<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">减速</span>。<br /><br />千珏在4秒内对目标进行的第三次攻击会引导狼灵扑击该敌人，造成额外<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(80/110/140/170/200 + ([[si:scalead]]100% 额外攻击力))</span>外加<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">5.5%已损失生命值的物理伤害</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">伤害可通过暴击几率和暴击伤害来提升，效能为50%。<br />对野怪的已损失生命值伤害的上限为200。</span>","tooltipSource":"communitydragon","range":[500,500,500,500,500],"rangeBurn":"500/500/500/500/500","image":{"full":"KindredEWrapper.png"},"rankValues":[{"label":"伤害","values":"80/110/140/170/200"},{"label":"冷却时间","values":"14/12.5/11/9.5/8"}],"scalings":[{"id":"damage","labelEn":"E Scaling","labelKo":"E 계수","parts":[{"stat":null,"coefficient":1,"op":"add","rawRef":"2:BaseBiteDamage"}]}],"conditions":[],"simulation":{"status":"expression","expression":{"id":"BaseBiteDamage","kind":"damage","damageType":"physical","root":{"kind":"product","parts":[{"kind":"sum","parts":[{"kind":"value","value":{"byRank":[80,110,140,170,200]}},{"kind":"stat","stat":"bonusAttackDamage","coefficient":{"byRank":[1,1,1,1,1]}}]},{"kind":"sum","parts":[{"kind":"value","value":{"byRank":[1,1,1,1,1]}},{"kind":"product","parts":[{"kind":"stat","stat":"critChance","coefficient":{"byRank":[0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5,0.5]}},{"kind":"sum","parts":[{"kind":"stat","stat":"critDamage","coefficient":{"byRank":[1,1,1,1,1]}},{"kind":"value","value":{"byRank":[-1,-1,-1,-1,-1]}}]}]}]}]},"requiresBuffStacks":false},"unsupportedPartTypes":["BuffCounterByCoefficientCalculationPart","nonlinear-product"]}},"icons":[{"file":"patch-notes/icons/de04751aac54df56e7403f1d72692c0c.webp","spellId":"KindredEWrapper"}]}},"KSante":{"W:辟路先锋":{"slot":"W","skill":{"id":"KSanteW","name":"辟路先锋","maxrank":5,"cooldown":[14,13,12,11,10],"cooldownBurn":"14/13/12/11/10","description":"奎桑提进行蓄力，期间获得伤害减免，然后进行冲刺，对敌人造成击退和晕眩。<br><br>在全盛姿态下，造成提升过的伤害并且不再造成击退或晕眩。","summary":"奎桑提进行蓄力，期间获得伤害减免，然后进行冲刺，对敌人造成击退和晕眩。<br><br>在全盛姿态下，造成提升过的伤害并且不再造成击退或晕眩。","tooltip":"奎桑提架起武器0.4-1.0秒，变为不可阻挡，并使即将到来的伤害降低25%。然后，他会向前猛撞，造成<span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">45/75/105/135/165 + (8% + ([[si:scalearmor]]每100点额外护甲2%) + ([[si:scalemr]]每100点额外魔法抗性2%))最大生命值的物理伤害</span>。会对命中的敌人们造成<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">击退</span>和0.5-1.75秒<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">晕眩</span>(基于蓄力时间)。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">全盛姿态：</span>冷却时间会刷新。造成额外的10-80%伤害(伤害类型为<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">真实伤害</span>，幅度基于蓄力时间)，伤害减免提升至70%并且冲刺速度提升，但不再造成<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">击退</span>或<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">晕眩</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">在90%蓄力时间时达到最大效果。<br />对野怪的最大伤害为180/260/340/420/500。</span>","tooltipSource":"communitydragon","cost":[45,50,55,60,65],"costBurn":"45/50/55/60/65","costType":"法力值","resource":"法力值","range":[600,600,600,600,600],"rangeBurn":"600/600/600/600/600","image":{"full":"KSanteW.png"},"rankValues":[{"label":"伤害","values":"45/75/105/135/165"},{"label":"冷却时间","values":"14/13/12/11/10"},{"label":"法力值消耗","values":"45/50/55/60/65"}],"scalings":[{"id":"damage","labelEn":"W Scaling","labelKo":"W 계수","parts":[{"stat":null,"coefficient":1,"op":"add","rawRef":"1:TotalMaxHealthDamage"}]}],"conditions":[],"simulation":{"status":"unavailable","unsupportedPartTypes":[]}}}},"Lillia":{"R:夜阑谣":{"slot":"R","skill":{"id":"LilliaR","name":"夜阑谣","maxrank":3,"cooldown":[150,130,110],"cooldownBurn":"150/130/110","description":"莉莉娅使所有带着【梦尘】的敌人陷入困倦状态，然后陷入昏睡状态。这些敌人在被强制唤醒时会受到额外伤害。","summary":"莉莉娅使所有带着【梦尘】的敌人陷入困倦状态，然后陷入昏睡状态。这些敌人在被强制唤醒时会受到额外伤害。","tooltip":"莉莉娅使所有带着<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">梦尘</span>的敌人陷入<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">困倦状态</span>1.5秒。此后，他们会陷入<span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">昏睡状态</span>2.5/2.75/3秒。<br /><br />在被伤害惊醒时，他们会受到额外的<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(100/150/200 + ([[si:scaleap]]40% 法术强度))魔法伤害</span>。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">【困倦状态】的单位会在期间内受到减速效果，然后陷入【昏睡状态】。<br />【昏睡状态】的单位无法移动或行动，直到被一名敌人用非周期性的伤害打醒为止。</span>","tooltipSource":"communitydragon","cost":[50,50,50],"costBurn":"50/50/50","costType":"法力值","resource":"法力值","range":[1600,1600,1600],"rangeBurn":"1600/1600/1600","image":{"full":"LilliaR.png"},"rankValues":[{"label":"冷却时间","values":"150/130/110"},{"label":"惊醒伤害","values":"100/150/200"},{"label":"持续时间","values":"2.5/2.75/3"}],"scalings":[{"id":"damage","labelEn":"R Scaling","labelKo":"R 계수","parts":[{"stat":null,"coefficient":1,"op":"add","rawRef":"3:TotalDamage"}]}],"conditions":[],"simulation":{"status":"complete","primary":{"id":"TotalDamage","kind":"damage","damageType":"magical","baseByRank":[100,150,200],"terms":[{"stat":"abilityPower","coefficientsByRank":[0.4000000059604645,0.4000000059604645,0.4000000059604645]}]},"unsupportedPartTypes":[]}},"icons":[{"file":"patch-notes/icons/c8a31d8415023b7538ea73819de7c2cd.webp","spellId":"LilliaR"}]}},"Mordekaiser":{"R:轮回绝境":{"slot":"R","skill":{"id":"MordekaiserR","name":"轮回绝境","maxrank":3,"cooldown":[120,110,100],"cooldownBurn":"120/110/100","description":"莫德凯撒将自身和他的目标拖拽到一个异次元空间，并偷取目标的一部分属性。如果他击杀了目标，那么会将这些属性保持到目标复活。","summary":"莫德凯撒将自身和他的目标拖拽到一个异次元空间，并偷取目标的一部分属性。如果他击杀了目标，那么会将这些属性保持到目标复活。","tooltip":"莫德凯撒将自身和一个敌方英雄放逐至死者领域7秒，并在期间内偷取该英雄10%的核心属性。